D3D11 DiscardView/DiscardView1/DiscardResource on render targets and depth buffers: the next render pass
loads the attachment with DontCare and the previous one stores it with DontCare (MSAA: resolve only, no sample
store). Clears also drop the store of the pass before them for color, and unmerged discards cost no extra encoder.

